                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "What news from Polaris? So you helped Clovis realize the logistical nightmare a squadron of Borealis Golem Inspectors would be, eh?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_MIR_15.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Good job! And you destroyed the Golem Pods once and for all? Even better! Then all is settled. Wait. Why are you handing me this Egg?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_MIR_16.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It's an unhatched Borealis Golem? Oh! Ummm... well... thing is, there's no way I could care for a Borealis Golem here.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/TarrakHadfield_MIR_17.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1340966,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Seeing as you've proved such an expert in them, maybe you should keep it. Yeah! It's all yours. Just promise to raise it right, OK?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
